---
import '../styles/custom.css';
---

<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>MamaSitas</title>
  </head>
  <body style="background-color: #1a0b10; margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;">
    <div class="main-hero">
      <img src="/_astro/houston.png" alt="MamaSitas Logo" class="hero-avatar" />
      <h1 class="hero-title">MamaSitas</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Всё о документах, легализации и жизни в Испании без лишней воды</p>

      <div class="hero-links">
        <a href="/guides/ex-26-autonomo/" class="hero-card">
          <span class="hero-icon">💼</span>
          <span class="hero-text">EX-26 Autónomo</span>
          <span class="hero-arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/guides/ex-26-cuenta-ajena/" class="hero-card">
          <span class="hero-icon">📋</span>
          <span class="hero-text">EX-26 Cuenta Ajena</span>
          <span class="hero-arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/guides/ex-25-menores/" class="hero-card">
          <span class="hero-icon">👶</span>
          <span class="hero-text">EX-25 Menores</span>
          <span class="hero-arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/reference/tasas/" class="hero-card">
          <span class="hero-icon">🧮</span>
          <span class="hero-text">Оплата пошлин (Tasas)</span>
          <span class="hero-arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://t.me/mamasitas_es" target="_blank" class="hero-card hero-card-telegram">
          <span class="hero-text">Telegram-канал MamaSitas</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
